{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:0.4"], "en": "The Verses of the Elder Mahāvaccha:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:1.1"], "en": "“Endowed with the power of wisdom, possessed of virtue and vows,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:1.2"], "en": "composed, delighting in meditation, and mindful;”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:1.3"], "en": "“While eating food for its purpose,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:1.4"], "en": "one who is free from passion should wait for the time here.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_thag_1.12:1.5"], "en": "… [Thus spoke] the Elder Mahāvaccha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:03:48Z"}
